<span>班級：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>日期：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>完成時長：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-parent-summary">
<div class="lf-ps-title">家長30秒摘要</div>
    本堂重點：<span class="lf-ps-tag trap">陷阱破解</span><span class="lf-ps-tag goal">掌握關鍵概念</span><span class="lf-ps-tag sspa">呈分試關聯</span><span class="lf-ps-tag hk">香港課程</span><br/>
<strong>學完本堂，小朋友將能夠：</strong>① 識別本課陷阱 ② 正確解題 ③ 應用口訣<br/>
<strong>常見錯誤：</strong>請留意講義中的警告框<br/>
<strong>家中鞏固建議：</strong>完成課後3題練習，重點留意陷阱題
  </div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題，5 分鐘）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！留意題目中嘅「陷阱關鍵字」— 佢會話你知邊度最易出錯！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<div class="lf-story"><div class="lf-story-title">🇭🇰 香港生活數學</div>數學喺日常生活中無處不在！由茶餐廳計數到搭車時間，由買嘢找續到睇樓面積，全部都係數學。今日我哋就用香港人嘅生活場景嚟學數學，等你發現：原來數學咁有用、咁好玩！</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>23 + 45 = ？（小二基礎，直式計算）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>156 + 32 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>8 + 5 = ？滿 10 了嗎？要進位嗎？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>300 + 500 = ？500 + 700 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>270 + 50 = ？想一想：70+50=120，所以係？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘） ＋ 例題練習</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：不進位加法（相同數位對齊）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 基礎</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>直式加法三步法：</strong><br>
      ① <strong>對齊數位</strong>：個位對個位、十位對十位、百位對百位、千位對千位<br>
      ② <strong>從個位加起</strong>：由右至左，逐位相加<br>
      ③ <strong>寫出答案</strong>：每一位的和寫在橫線下面
    </br></br></br></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-why">
<div class="lf-why-title">WHY BOX：為甚麼有這麼多不同單位？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;">
mm→cm→m→km（相差10/100/1000倍）<br/>
<b>口訣：</b>大→小：乘；小→大：除<br/>
3.5km=3500m ✅（不是350m！）<br/>
<em style="color:#6B7280;">km→m乘1000，kg→g乘1000，L→mL乘1000。</em>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：不進位加法</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q" style="font-family:monospace;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;">
    2341<br/>+ 1528<br/>──────<br/>  3869
  </div>
<div style="font-size:13px;">千位：2+1=3 | 百位：3+5=8 | 十位：4+2=6 | 個位：1+8=9 ✓</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">3215 + 4632 = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>1523 + 3246 = ？（用直式）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>4302 + 2695 = ？（用直式）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>6120 + 3859 = ？（用直式計算）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>2034 + 5043 + 2010 = ？（三個數相加）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：進位加法（一次進位）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      當某一位相加 <strong>≥ 10</strong> 時，就要<strong>進位</strong>！<br/>
      ① 個位加滿 10 → 進 1 到十位<br/>
      ② 十位加滿 10 → 進 1 到百位<br/>
      ③ 百位加滿 10 → 進 1 到千位<br/>
<strong>記住：</strong>「滿十進一，進位要寫細字提醒自己！」
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3：個位進位</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q" style="font-family:monospace;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;">
     ¹<br/>  2568<br/>+ 1527<br/>──────<br/>  4095
  </div>
<div style="font-size:13px;">個位：8+7=15 → 寫5，<span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:700;">進1</span>到十位 | 十位：6+2+<span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:700;">1</span>=9 | 百位：5+5=10 → 寫0，<span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:700;">進1</span>到千位 | 千位：2+1+<span style="color:var(--red);font-weight:700;">1</span>=4</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 4：進位陷阱（連續進位）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q" style="font-family:monospace;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;">
      3998<br/>+   25<br/>──────
    </div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 小陷阱怪獸 #1：進位時忘記加「進咗嘅 1」！記住：進位嘅 1 要寫喺上面，加下一位時一定要加埋佢！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 小陷阱怪獸 #2：連續進位——當你進咗位之後，下一位加完又滿 10，要再進位！唔好停！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>4567 + 2845 = ？（用直式，留意進位）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>6298 + 1815 = ？（用直式）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>3999 + 8 = ？（連續進位考題！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>5472 + 3659 = ？（用直式）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：加法估算<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>估算 = 用近似值快速計出大概答案</strong><br/>
      ① 把每個數<strong>四捨五入</strong>到最接近的百位或千位<br/>
      ② 用心算加埋<br/>
      ③ 估算用「≈」（大約等於）符號<br/>
<strong>估算用處：</strong>檢查真正答案是否合理！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 5</div><div class="lf-ex-q">估算：2341 + 5689 ≈ ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">2341 ≈ 2300，5689 ≈ 5700<br/>2300 + 5700 = <strong>8000</strong>（真正答案 = 8030，非常接近！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 6</div><div class="lf-ex-q">估算：3876 + 4125 ≈ ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">3876 ≈ 3900，4125 ≈ 4100<br/>3900 + 4100 = <strong>8000</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>估算：2543 + 3389 ≈ ？先估算，再精確計算，比較差距</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>估算：5089 + 2911 ≈ ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 基礎層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>1234 + 5432 = ？（直式：對齊位值）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>345 + 2867 = ？（小心：一個三位數加四位數，要對齊！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>1678 + 2534 = ？（需要進位）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
