<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>小明計 2478+3659=5,037，小華話係 6,137。點判斷邊個啱？（用估算！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 挑戰層（共 3 題）</div>
